<h1>Import</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Imports CAD models by using Tolerance and Neighbour distance parameters.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>FileName</b></i></span> – fully qualified file name of the file that has to be imported.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Tolerance</b></i></span> – maximum allowable distance between the original surface or solid and the midpoints of the polygon edges from the triangulated surface.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>NeighbourDistance</b></i></span> – maximum allowable distance between points from different sub-meshes that will be assumed as single surface and unified together<span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>UseACISHealing</b></i></span> – sets whether to use optimised algorithms for import<span lang="EN-GB">. Available values are</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>Yes</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>No</i></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>File &gt; Open from the main menu. Open button on the toolbar <img src="../Images/Image16.gif" width="24px" height="24px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">. <b>Ctrl + O</b> shortcut.</i></span></p>
<p class="Note"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> Use this macro command for the following file types: <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>IGES</b></span> (*.igs, *.iges), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>VDA</b></span> (*.vda), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>VDA Polylines</b></span> (*.vda), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>STEP</b></span> (*.stp, *.step), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Pro/ENGINEER</b></span> (*.prt), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Unigraphics</b></span> (*.asm), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>CATIA v4</b></span> (*.exp, *.model, *.session), and <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>CATIA v5</b></span> (*.CATPart, *.CATProduct). Please note that this list might be changed in future versions.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Import( FileName="C:\CAD Models\Model_1.igs", Tolerance=0.01, NeighbourDistance=0.3, UseACISHealing=No )</p>
